            "heading": "How do I replace the brush head?",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Your toothbrush comes with 3 brush heads included. To replace, simply pull off the old head and push the new one until it clicks securely. Replacements can be purchased anytime.<\/p>",
